Hi all,

I tried to build gotop [0;1;2] on ppc. To build the binary golang-go
(>= 1.5) is needed but not available on ports. Hence I tried to
build golang-go from sources. On ppc it doesn't build the
binary golang-go, though. BTW building the binary on i386 and amd64
runs smoothly.

Anybody here running gotop on ppc?

[0] https://github.com/cjbassi/gotop
[1] https://salsa.debian.org/debian/gotop
[2] https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=921276

Elimar

